<title>USA: CoVest Bancshares completes conversion.</title>
<headline>CoVest Bancshares completes conversion.</headline>
<dateline>DES PLAINES, Ill. 1997-08-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>CoVest Bancshares Inc said Monday its CoVest Banc unit completed the conversion process to a national bank from a federally insured thrift.</p>
<p>As of June 30, 1997, CoVest Bancshares had consolidated assets of $536.4 million, the company said.</p>
<p>CoVest shares were up 1/4 at 22 Monday.</p>
<p>((--Chicago newsdesk, 312-408-8787))</p>
